<title>USA: River Forest, Ill., won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>River Forest, Ill., won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik said it won $6 million of River Forest, Ill., general obligation (alternate revenue source) Series 1996 A, with a net interest cost of 5.00 percent.</p>
